[l_braz_por.coastal_bunker]
Forte costeiro

[l_braz_por.coastal_bunker_desc]
Essa construção inflige uma penalidade de ataque de $VALUE|+%0$ para cada nível de forte do atacante em combates de invasão naval.

[l_braz_por.coastal_bunker_plural]
Fortes costeiros

[l_braz_por.modifier_production_speed_coastal_bunker_factor]
Velocidade de edificação de casamatas litorâneas

[l_braz_por.modifier_production_speed_coastal_bunker_factor_desc]
Modifica a velocidade de edificação de casamatas litorâneas.

[l_english.coastal_bunker]
Coastal Fort

[l_english.coastal_bunker_desc]
This building inflicts an attack penalty of $VALUE|+%0$ for each fort level on the attacker in naval invasion combat.

[l_english.coastal_bunker_plural]
Coastal Forts

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_coastal_bunker_factor]
§YCoastal Fort§! construction speed

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_coastal_bunker_factor_desc]
Modifies the speed of Coastal bunker construction.

[l_french.coastal_bunker]
Fort côtier

[l_french.coastal_bunker_desc]
En cas de débarquement, ce type de bâtiments inflige à l'assaillant une pénalité offensive de $VALUE|+%0$ par niveau de fortification.

[l_french.coastal_bunker_plural]
Forts côtiers

[l_french.modifier_production_speed_coastal_bunker_factor]
Vitesse de constr. des fortif. côtières 

[l_french.modifier_production_speed_coastal_bunker_factor_desc]
Modifie la vitesse de construction des fortifications côtières.

[l_german.coastal_bunker]
Küstenbefestigung

[l_german.coastal_bunker_desc]
Verursacht während einer Invasion für jede Befestigungsstufe einen Angriffsmalus von $VALUE|+%0$ beim Angreifer.

[l_german.coastal_bunker_plural]
Küstenbefestigungen

[l_german.modifier_production_speed_coastal_bunker_factor]
Baugeschwindigkeit (Küstenbefestigungen)

[l_german.modifier_production_speed_coastal_bunker_factor_desc]
Modifiziert die Baugeschwindigkeit für Küstenbefestigungen.

[l_japanese.coastal_bunker]
沿岸要塞

